        dct:description "contoured-rendering k* = 18 = √3k/2k harmonic of tanh∘argmax_φ (normalised power at k/√3k/2k = 0.97/1.00/0.17); FFT lattice class = hexagonal" ;
        schema:measurementTechnique "dominant radial FFT wavenumber of the linear 3-mode hexagonal eigenmode superposition (non-contoured, weak tanh); the rendered wavenumber is q*/d_hyp quantised to integer cycles on the 2πβ/ε torus" ;
